# World Facts

## Characters
- **Kara Voss**: Station engineer, late 30s, practical and resourceful. Stayed behind alone on Station Halcyon after the evacuation three years ago. Has recurring dreams of a humming sound from the planet below.

## Setting
- **Station Halcyon**: A largely abandoned orbital research station orbiting the dead planet Erebos-9. Rusted, aging infrastructure; skeleton crew of one (Kara).
- **Erebos-9**: A dead planet below the station, believed lifeless. Contains a buried "world-engine" of ancient, unknown origin.
- **The Coalition**: A distant fleet/governing authority that ordered the evacuation of the Erebos-9 system three years ago.

## World Rules / Lore
- The world-engine beneath Erebos-9's crust was thought inert but has begun emitting an encoded signal.
- The signal contains an unknown script with the repeated word "Awaken."
- The signal is aimed specifically at Station Halcyon.